 "intro": [
  "Cairnholt was the smallest of the barrow-lords. The others have heard, and they have gathered behind the oldest of them, Morrow of the Deep Fen, who was a barrow-lord before Ysmay was born. They would rather go on sleeping than serve.",
  "This is a war chapter. Your court builds and raises troops as in a skirmish: workers gather, dwellings raise the dead, and you can raise up to tier 3 here, gravecrawlers. While Morrow and his lords hold all three of their halls, his dead march on your court again and again.",
  "Take Greywater and Hesk's Howe, or win Lady Hesk to your side. Then break Morrow of the Deep Fen."
 ],
